.DS_Store
.venv/
__pycache__/
data/raw/
data/engine.duckdb
# data/raw-melee/ is deliberately NOT ignored, where data/raw above is. An MTGO
# event can be refetched from a stable public archive any time. A paper
# Spotlight is fifteen hundred decklist pages on a third-party site, scraped
# rather than served by an API, for an event that is over: the same reason the
# hand-transcribed meta snapshots are committed.
# The ledger itself is committed: it is the engine's memory of what it has
# raised, and a flag whose appearance has left the fresh window is in no cache
# to rebuild from. Only the write-ahead file is transient.
data/flags.partial
# The pilot's own match logs and what parses out of them: personal data,
# opponent logins included, and restorable from the MTGO client machine.
data/gamelogs/
data/matches.jsonl
reports/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
